# ================= 0.2 AdminPage: /exploreadmin (spec 6; Spots | Checklist | Island; list left, editor right). 0.2.2 = the vanilla look
# from tools/skyyui.py: the decorated @DecoratedContainer window (an editor, like the vanilla SkyyRanks editor), the tab row, fixed-width
# list rows on the list well, vanilla text fields (InputBox) and buttons (Primary = the row's main action, Secondary = neutral / navigation,
# Destructive = Remove, Tertiary / Tertiary_Active = the ON / OFF toggles), the result line in the vanilla + / - / = colours. The logic,
# element ids, b.set texts, event bindings, EventData and handleDataEvent are 0.2.1's. No periodic updates, no timers, no hover handlers:
